#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0001-A expect=noViolation domain=APDM
#note "Negative control: the dataset is named APDM and every record carries DOMAIN=APDM, so the first 4 characters of the dataset name equal DOMAIN and prefix(dataset_name, 4) != DOMAIN is false. Paired with the -invalid- twin so neither can pass vacuously; first fixture for this id (PLAN-zero-row-routing-rekey.md phase 2)."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset APDM label="Associated Persons Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col APID    type=Char label="Associated Persons Identifier"
col RSUBJID type=Char label="Related Subject Identifier"
col SREL    type=Char label="Subject Relationship"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | APDM | AP-001 | 01-701-1015 | MOTHER, BIOLOGICAL
---
